  // picture each run. It is refused when it is a product photo.
  // A SIGNED, EXPIRING LINK IS NOT A SAVED FRONT PAGE PICTURE. Meta's generator serves its
  // pictures from fbcdn behind a signature that expires, and the shop stored that address as its
  // own banner - so the banner went dead within hours and the page came back with no picture at
  // all. Such a link is refused here so the shop is given a rehosted, permanent copy.
  // Declared here as well because a Code node cannot see another node's variables.
