const STRONG_SERVICE = /salon|barber|spa|repair|electrician|plumbing|plumber|tailor|tutor|tuition|consult|laundry|cleaning|photograph|massage|clinic|mechanic|installation|car wash|makeup|make-up|nails|manicure|pedicure|braid|fitness|gym|lesson|therapy|welding|carpentry|hairdress|beauty|grooming/i;
