// and money is settled once, on the order form, where the buyer is shown Card or PayPal. Keeping
// "Pay on delivery" / "Mobile Money" tiles on every card read as a menu of payment methods before
// the buyer had chosen anything, so they are gone.
// The merchant's own wording wins over anything the system would write. A massage parlour was
// being told "Pay on delivery", which is meaningless for a service: the wording now follows the
